                  Constant(value='Directed global digital transformation programs, modernizing legacy systems and reducing regulatory cycles through cloud migrations.'),
                  Constant(value='As co-founder and CTO, led all technology strategy, product development, and team management from concept to launch.'),
                  Constant(value='Managed 18-person enterprise risk team providing strategic guidance to financial institutions on capital adequacy and regulatory modeling.'),
                  Constant(value='Advanced from actuarial analyst to senior consultant, building quantitative and computational foundation for technology career.')])),
